---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import DocToc from '../../../components/ui/DocToc.astro';
import '../../../styles/policy-page.css';

const toc = [
  { id: 'collection', label: '1. Data Collection & Storage' },
  { id: 'backup', label: '2. Data Backup & Portability' },
  { id: 'analytics', label: '3. Analytics & Error Reporting' },
  { id: 'permissions', label: '4. App Permissions' },
  { id: 'contact', label: '5. Contact Us' },
  { id: 'summary', label: 'Your Wellbeing, Your Data' },
];
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy - Felisca"
  description="Privacy Policy for Felisca app. Learn how we protect your wellbeing data with complete offline storage."
  canonical="https://pasichdev.xyz/apps/felisca/privacy-policy"
  bleed
>
  <header class="page-hero pp-hero">
    <nav class="page-hero__crumbs mono up" aria-label="Breadcrumbs"><a href="/">pasichdev</a><span><a href="/apps/felisca">Felisca</a></span><span>Privacy Policy</span></nav>
    <p class="pp-hero__app mono up">Felisca</p>
    <h1 class="wide" data-scramble>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="page-hero__lede">
      Your privacy is our priority. Learn how we protect your data and ensure complete confidentiality in Felisca.
    </p>
    <div class="page-hero__meta mono up">
      <span class="pp-badge">Local storage</span>
      <span class="pp-badge">Offline first</span>
      <span class="pp-badge">No tracking</span>
      <span class="pp-date"><strong>Last updated:</strong> February 4, 2026</span>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="doc">
    <DocToc items={toc} />

    <article class="doc__body">

      <div class="pp-keys">
        <div class="pp-key">
          <h3>Local Storage</h3>
          <p>All your mood data and notes are stored exclusively on your device in a protected SQLite database. We have no access to your content.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pp-key">
          <h3>No Cloud Sync</h3>
          <p>We do not use cloud servers to store your history. We do not transmit your data to third parties.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pp-key">
          <h3>Complete Anonymity</h3>
          <p>The app works offline and does not require creating an account, registration, or personal identification.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2 id="collection">1. Data Collection &amp; Storage</h2>
      <p>
        All data you enter into the app (focus metrics, energy levels, anxiety levels, notes, sleep data, and caffeine intake) are stored <strong>exclusively locally</strong> on your device in a protected SQLite database.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>We have no access to your data</li>
        <li>We do not use cloud servers for storing your history</li>
        <li>We do not transmit your data to third parties</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 id="backup">2. Data Backup &amp; Portability</h2>
      <p>
        Since data is stored locally, you are fully responsible for it. The app provides an export feature in CSV format, allowing you to:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Create manual backups</li>
        <li>Transfer data to another device</li>
        <li>Analyze your data with external tools</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 id="analytics">3. Analytics &amp; Error Reporting</h2>
      <p>
        To improve app stability, we use <strong>Sentry</strong> for collecting anonymous crash reports. These reports:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Do not contain your personal data or journal entries</li>
        <li>Help us identify and fix technical issues only</li>
        <li>Are completely anonymous</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 id="permissions">4. App Permissions</h2>
      <p>
        Felisca may request the following permissions:
      </p>
      <div class="pp-items">
        <div class="pp-item">
          <h3>Notifications</h3>
          <p>For sending daily check-in reminders.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pp-item">
          <h3>Biometrics</h3>
          <p>For protecting app access via FaceID or fingerprint authentication.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pp-item">
          <h3>File System</h3>
          <p>Exclusively for saving (export) or reading (import) CSV files at your request.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2 id="contact">5. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>
        If you have questions or suggestions for improving Felisca, you can send us feedback through the app or contact the developer directly via email.
      </p>

      <section class="pp-closing">
        <h2 id="summary">Your Wellbeing, Your Data</h2>
        <p>
          Felisca is built on the principle that your feelings, focus levels, and energy data are your personal business. They should never leave your device, never be sold, and never be tracked. We respect your privacy completely.
        </p>
        <p class="pp-small">
          © 2026 Felisca Team. All data belongs to you.
        </p>
      </section>

      <p class="pp-back"><a href="/apps/felisca" class="back-link">Back to Felisca</a></p>
    </article>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
